ト番号は@ポートで指定できます。指定されないときにはデフォルトのポート番号（port）が使われます```","ts":"1626950316.467800","edited":{"user":"U06ECBRTJ","ts":"1626950320.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AfB0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff9c4ac8-f8b1-4d65-886c-b679a3b9fc14","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"インタフェース指定ってデバイスの指定じゃなくてIPなの?","ts":"1626950250.467600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AJg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b288f8bd-a1f5-4e6c-8d09-ceb0ebb95043","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"んー","ts":"1626950054.467200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LrN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec445e06-53fb-440d-aecd-a002e33cccf4","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"`interface: 0.0.0.0` な設定すると、あとから生える 235 で動作するけど、`interface: 10.1.20.200` にすると、そっちになるなー","ts":"1626950052.467000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+qdJs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"189f49b2-77a9-482a-9886-1ea1609beb03","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"設定ファイルをバックアップして、初期状態でも同じ問題が発生するかどうか調べた方がいいかも。","ts":"1626949754.466100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r4d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04c9494b-ddd8-4d7d-a46d-52eaf9bf2457","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ああ、IPv4のほうか、そっちが複数は謎やね\nunboundの設定ファイル関係からか?","ts":"1626949631.465500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GNMOV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"057dc39b-a09c-4964-8380-7813769d1f4e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"unbound を起動すると、235 な IP が生えるっぽい","ts":"1626949584.465000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"egtd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"125c6b8b-ff4a-44be-af86-386d12cc6bca","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"複数出るのは、前はMACベースと乱数のであったけど、今は基本乱数のだけのはずだけど...\nただ、サーバは固定アドレスあったほうがいろいろいいのはあるが\nまず2つある理由を探すところかな?","ts":"1626949564.464600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Zk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dbd00250-231d-4809-a486-8b57828402e7","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"こういう時どうすればいいんだっけなぁ","ts":"1626949305.463300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VE1y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed770b06-6a1a-4102-94e6-795a04073941","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"で、secondary 側で listen されてる","ts":"1626949297.463000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vqtm0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e88765d4-6c90-4e41-9ea1-2479ffc1f86f","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"```$ ip a show enp3s0f2\n2: enp3s0f2: \u0026lt;BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP,LOWER_UP\u0026gt; mtu 1500 qdisc fq_codel state UP group default qlen 1000\n    link/ether e0:3f:49:d6:9f:b7 brd ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff\n    inet 10.1.20.200/24 brd 10.1.20.255 scope global enp3s0f2\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n    inet 10.1.20.235/24 brd 10.1.20.255 scope global secondary noprefixroute enp3s0f2\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n    inet6 2405:6583:8360:302:17fc:e611:6ca5:abdc/64 scope global dynamic mngtmpaddr noprefixroute\n       valid_lft 14345sec preferred_lft 12545sec\n    inet6 2405:6583:8360:302:e23f:49ff:fed6:9fb7/64 scope global dynamic mngtmpaddr noprefixroute\n       valid_lft 14345sec preferred_lft 12545sec\n    inet6 fe80::e23f:49ff:fed6:9fb7/64 scope link\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever```","ts":"1626949281.462600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ovfsQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79f0e5d5-551a-4af8-ba50-c8d522930bd3","type":"